       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. IMSDSAT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SSA-AREA PIC X(256).
       01 PACKED-KEY PIC S9(11) COMP-3 VALUE 12345678901.
       01 EXPECTED-KEY PIC X(6) VALUE X'12345678901C'.
       01 CALL-RC PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE SPACES TO SSA-AREA
           STRING 'PAUTSUM0' '(' 'ACCNTID ' 'EQ'
               DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO SSA-AREA
           END-STRING
           CALL STATIC 'IMSDSA' USING SSA-AREA PACKED-KEY
               RETURNING CALL-RC
           IF CALL-RC NOT = ZERO OR
               SSA-AREA(20:6) NOT = EXPECTED-KEY OR
               SSA-AREA(26:1) NOT = ')'
               MOVE 8 TO RETURN-CODE
               GOBACK
           END-IF
           DISPLAY 'IMS PACKED SSA OK'
           GOBACK.
